<title>FRANCE: France to hold Thomson briefing 1000 GMT.</title>
<headline>France to hold Thomson briefing 1000 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French finance, industry and defence ministers will give a news conference on the privatisation of electronics group Thomson SA at 1000 GMT, a government official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Finance Minister Jean Arthuis, Industry Minister Franck Borotra and Defence Minister Charles Millon will give the briefing, the official said.</p>
<p>The government earlier said it preferred Lagardere's bid for Thomson and was referring its offer and that of rival Alcatel Alsthom to the Privatisation Commission before a final decision was made.</p>
</text>
